    DBOp -.->|metrics serving cert| ServiceCA[OpenShift Service CA]
    Monitoring["OpenShift monitoring /<br/>data-science-collector"] -->|scrapes /metrics 8443| DBOp

    %% Consumers
    Consumers["Consuming components<br/>model registry, feature store, ..."] -->|DatabaseClaim / SchemaClaim| DBOp
