    %% Cluster-provided dependencies
    DBOp -->|API server 6443| K8sAPI[Kubernetes API]
    DBOp -->|Internal TLS + webhook cert| CertManager[cert-manager]
    DBOp -->|SCC odh-db-internal-postgres| OpenShift[OpenShift SCC]

    %% Data backends
    DBOp -->|operand image| PGImage["rhel9/postgresql-16<br/>Internal provider"]
    DBOp -->|admin connection| ExtPG["External PostgreSQL<br/>admin-managed"]

    %% Key Go libraries
    DBOp -->|operator framework| CR["controller-runtime v0.25.1"]
    DBOp -->|k8s clients| ClientGo["client-go / api v0.37.1"]
    DBOp -->|PostgreSQL driver| Pgx["jackc/pgx v5.10.0"]
    DBOp -->|templates| Renderer["renderer-gotemplate"]
    DBOp -->|CLI + config| Cobra["cobra / viper"]
    DBOp -->|metrics| PromClient["prometheus client_golang v1.24.0"]
    DBOp -->|platform/SCC types| OSAPI[openshift/api]

